---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AtlasMap from '../components/AtlasMap.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Luxury Atlas | Lalitha Manogna Kasturi">
  <section class="tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Luxury Atlas</span>
        <h2>A Map of the Brands I Keep Coming Back To</h2>
        <p>Luxury is global, but it doesn't look the same everywhere. France has its maisons and craftsmanship. Italy has its relationship with design and materials. Switzerland has its watchmaking. Japan has its precision and restraint. India has an incredible relationship with craft, culture and ceremony. I created the Atlas because I want to understand where these differences come from.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="atlas-note reveal"><span class="pulse"></span> Countries in gold have research on file, more are added over time</div>
      <AtlasMap />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why I Made This</span>
      </div>
      <div class="prose reveal">
        <p>I don't want the Atlas to simply become a list of luxury brands. I want it to help me understand why luxury developed differently in different places.</p>
        <p>Because where a brand comes from often tells you something about how it thinks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
